Subject: [PATCH 40/43] ARM: dts: qcom: msm8226-motorola-titan: Add SD card

The changes to l18 prevent error -110 when reading the SD card. See
this Fairphone 2 commit for reference:
https://github.com/msm8974-mainline/linux/commit/27fe0fc05f354183581236090fccf70b258f5939

Signed-off-by: David Wales <daviewales@disroot.org>
(cherry picked from commit a8e4969897eefecc3656bbd19a50c02f0fb5cfb5)
